# Mobile Redesign Plan: Profile & Career Section

A comprehensive redesign proposal and implementation plan for the **Profile & Career Dossier** (`#profile`), focusing specifically on mobile screen display, intuitive sequential navigation, an upgraded Tech Arsenal layout, and a text-first certification display.

---

## 1. Overview of Mobile Experience Redesign

### Current Desktop/Tablet Structure
On desktop and tablet screens, the Profile section operates as a **Dual-Track Dossier**:
- **Left Column**: Sticky navigation rail with 6 categories (01 Bio, 02 Experience, 03 Tech Arsenal, 04 Education, 05 Milestones, 06 Certifications) with a vertical progress track.
- **Right Column**: Content cards stacked vertically with rich editorial details.

